<title>USA: Former Sony executive joins Animation Sciences.</title>
<headline>Former Sony executive joins Animation Sciences.</headline>
<dateline>SUNNYVALE, Calif. 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Animation Science Corp on Monday said Michael Schulhof joined the company as chairman of the board.</p>
<p>Schulhof was president and chief executive of Sony Corp's U.S. unit.</p>
<p>Privately held Animation Science develops interactive simulation and animation software for the movie, multimedia, electronic-gaming and industrial markets.</p>
</text>
